  "description": "When country boy Yewang enrolls at the prestigious Yeonghwa Academy to follow his favorite idol Jena Lee, he expects a life of glitz and glamor among Korea’s future elite. But he’s in for a rude awakening when he finds himself at the very bottom of the social ladder upon his arrival and targeted by the school bullies. Not only that, bullying seems to be normalized at Yeonghwa Academy, with victims designated as “Loafs”, who are essentially free targets. Finding allies along the way, Yewang sets out to fight back against his bullies and the school’s strict hierarchy.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
